{"id": "EUVD-2026-108821", "enisaUuid": "3f4fe5e4-39ec-356e-a11a-c8371b1e3065", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: team: free skb when broadcast has no txable port\n\nbc_transmit() sends the original skb through the last txable port.\nWhen no port is txable, it returns false without consuming the skb, but\nteam_xmit() still returns NETDEV_TX_OK. AF_PACKET sends then retain the\nskb and its socket write-memory charge.\n\nA TX-enabled, link-down port keeps the broadcast transmit op installed.\nCarrier can stay up through a second link-up, TX-disabled port or be\nforced on by userspace. Free the original skb on the no-port path while\nleaving the existing drop accounting intact.\n\nDiscovered by Sashiko during review of previous commit.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T12:21:13", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T12:21:13", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/961563117626f4681623077ec0cfd86f86da0d49", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f34b1bcac4581a5bd3daf9eff90f175e736b54aa", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/489114c9ecae44e523361a4b3e610ee5ebd9189c"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-99026"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2d624996-2b0b-3c6a-a337-50cae9e24ade", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5fc889911a99043a97da1daa0d010ad72cbc3042 <489114c9ecae44e523361a4b3e610ee5ebd9189c"}, {"id": "2ff6fd04-f9c8-3ab5-9647-52175fc03560", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.57"}, {"id": "75d95564-5dd3-380e-ae1d-a268be975ed4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3.6"}, {"id": "7b5a26d6-bece-3fb3-978e-51e14a622bfa", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.11"}, {"id": "92f0ac0a-cace-3e3c-be12-7ade34fc6c33", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5fc889911a99043a97da1daa0d010ad72cbc3042 <961563117626f4681623077ec0cfd86f86da0d49"}, {"id": "b1ef3382-d484-31d1-be17-639cb4ab9fba", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5fc889911a99043a97da1daa0d010ad72cbc3042 <f34b1bcac4581a5bd3daf9eff90f175e736b54aa"}, {"id": "d642be44-4963-32f0-a055-0d5b968809da", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "e7c4b46a-6299-3c05-b2c3-958b5f3a1459", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "222d18a5-4037-38ec-8d20-deaa1e06d4a9", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}